+def scanLinkLabel(src: str, start: int, maximum: int) -> int:
+    """Find the end of a link label whose content starts at ``start``
+    (just after its ``[``).
+
+    A link label ends with the first right bracket that is not backslash
+    escaped; it may not contain unescaped left brackets, and has at most 999
+    characters inside the brackets
+    (https://spec.commonmark.org/0.31.2/#link-label).
